    "description": "A new free music rhythm game. \r\nHow to play\r\n\r\n1.Tap the colorful note as it reaches scoring area. \r\n2. According to the accuracy of tap you'll get a score. \r\n3. Try to challenge harder songs. \r\nVarious types of songs and well-made Musical score is continuously update. Pop, Anime, Hip-hop, EDM, Vocaloid, and more genre of music are waiting for you. \r\n\r\nGame Features \r\n1.Variou of songs, play anytime as you want. \r\n2.Choose your own character\r\n3.Different difficulty makes more choice, choose the difficulty that you like the most! \r\n4.Use high quality music source and musical score, make your game experience better. \r\n5.Continuously update various songs. \r\n\r\nInstall right now and enjoy it! \r\nBeat Fight is a music game from Jingmao Tec. Contact us by Google Play or email below. We're looking forward to your game feedback to improve our game!\r\n \r\nFeedback \r\nbeatrun11e@gmail.com \r\nThe app follows standard Apple Terms of Use (EULA) \r\nhttps://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/",
